## Purpose
This license allows each user to run, copy, modify, and combine this software for 
noncommercial purposes, but not for commercial purposes.

## Agreement
In order to receive this license, you have to agree to its terms. If you do not 
agree to this license, you must not use or distribute this software.

## Notices
You must ensure that everyone who gets a copy of any part of this software from you, 
with or without changes, also gets the text of this license or a link to 
https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0.

## License
Subject to the terms of this license, the licensor grants each user that agrees to 
this license a perpetual, worldwide, nonexclusive, royalty-free, and fully paid-up 
copyright license, without the right to sublicense, to run, modify, and combine this 
software, and to copy resulting modified software.

You may also distribute copies of this software, or resulting modified software, but 
only for noncommercial purposes.

## Noncommercial Purposes
Any use of this software is for noncommercial purposes unless it is for a commercial purpose.

A use is for a commercial purpose if:
1. it is made by or on behalf of an enterprise, and that enterprise or an affiliate receives 
   any monetary or other commercial advantage or compensation from that use, or
2. it is made by or on behalf of an individual, and that individual or an affiliate receives 
   any monetary or other commercial advantage or compensation from that use.

Commercial purposes include, but are not limited to:
1. using this software to develop or provide software, goods, or services to third parties for compensation;
2. charging fees to access or use this software, or software, goods, or services that include this software;
3. distributing this software with commercial software, goods, or services;
4. selling, renting, leasing, sublicensing, or publishing this software on commercial marketplaces without authorization.

Personal, educational, academic, and non-profit research uses are noncommercial purposes.

## Fair Use
You may make "fair use" of this software, as that phrase is understood under copyright law, but no more.

## Patents
Subject to the terms of this license, the licensor grants each user that agrees to this 
license a perpetual, worldwide, nonexclusive, royalty-free, and fully paid-up patent license, 
without the right to sublicense, to make, have made, use, and import this software, but only 
to the extent necessary to use the copyright license granted above.

If you bring a patent lawsuit against the licensor or anyone else claiming that this software 
infringes any patent, your licenses under this license terminate immediately.

## Trademarks
This license does not grant any trademark, service mark, or other trademark rights.

## Defensive Termination
If you make any claim that this software, or any part of it, infringes any copyright, patent, 
or other intellectual property right, your licenses under this license terminate immediately.

## No Warranty
As far as the law allows, this software comes as is, without any warranty or condition, 
and no contributor will be liable to anyone for any damages, related to this software or 
this license, under any kind of legal claim.

